# Domestika

> Domestika is the largest creative community. Learn and share from anywhere with online courses taught by top professionals in the world of design and creativity. This file links to Markdown versions of the site optimized for LLMs.

- [Full course catalog](https://www.domestika.org/llms-full.txt): Top courses of every category, all in one file.

Every page linked below has a Markdown version at the same address with `.md` appended,
and so does every course: a course page at `/{language}/courses/{id}-{slug}` answers at
`/{language}/courses/{id}-{slug}.md` with its description, who it is for, its final
project, its requirements and its lesson outline. There are too many course pages to
list here, so follow the listings below to find them.

The blog follows the same convention: an article at `/{language}/blog/{id}-{slug}`
answers at `/{language}/blog/{id}-{slug}.md` with its text, images and tags. Start
from the blog index at `/{language}/blog` to find the articles.

## Español

- [Categorías de cursos](https://www.domestika.org/es/courses/category.md): Todas las categorías de cursos de Domestika. Cada enlace apunta a una lista en Markdown de los cursos de esa categoría.
- [Cursos por área](https://www.domestika.org/es/courses/area.md): Cursos de Domestika organizados por área de aplicación. Cada enlace apunta a una lista en Markdown de los cursos de esa área.
- [Cursos por software](https://www.domestika.org/es/courses/software.md): Cursos de Domestika organizados por el software que enseñan. Cada enlace apunta a una lista en Markdown de los cursos de ese software.

